  "body": "A rare opportunity in a tightly held Castor Bay location.\r\nFlexible settlement terms available - the vendor is open to a long settlement date, providing added flexibility for the right buyer.\r\nSet on approximately 809sqm of freehold land, this original four-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers strong potential for buyers looking to renovate, rebuild, or investigate future development options.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n* Approx. 809sqm freehold land\r\n* 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms\r\n* Elevated sea views toward Rangitoto\r\n* Relatively gentle site contour\r\n* Renovation, rebuild or development potential\r\n* Zoned for Westlake Boys & Girls High Schools\r\n* Close to beaches, shops and transport\r\n* Motivated vendor - must be sold\r\n\r\nThe home needs work, but the fundamentals are hard to replace: land, location, elevation and views.\r\n\r\nAny subdivision or redevelopment is subject to Council approval and purchaser due diligence.\r\n\r\nConjunctional are welcome\r\n\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files, please copy and paste the below link into your web browser: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M1PU",
